                    <h3 class="review-title">Friendly team delivered the perfect filing cabinet solution</h3>
                    <div class="review-body">
                        <p>We have been looking for the right type of filing cabinet for a long time and finally found one at an affordable price at JasonL. The people at JasonL were super friendly and very accommodating and arranged delivery on the day I was home. They do all sorts of other office furniture as well but I couldn't be more happy with their support and willingness to assist you and the end outcome. Something rare these days. Thanks heaps to the entire team for going out of their way to arrange delivery of a super product.</p>
                    </div>
                    <p class="reviewer-name">- Joe Foley</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
